        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Salva, Emilio Fernández\n- Films: Jeepers Creepers 2\n- Companies: American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, Myriad Pictures, United Artists, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Emilio Fernández was born as Emilio Fernández Romo on March 26, 1904, and he died on August 6, 1986.\n- Emilio Fernández, also known as \"El Indio,\" was a Mexican film director, actor, and screenwriter.\n- Victor Ronald Salva was born on March 29, 1958.\n- Victor Salva is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 is a 2003 American horror film.\n- Victor Salva wrote and directed Jeepers Creepers 2.\n- American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, and Myriad Pictures produced Jeepers Creepers 2.\n- United Artists, a division of Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, distributed Jeepers Creepers 2.",
